8. NUMERICAL VERIFICATION
======================================================================

Verification framework includes:

    mesh convergence
    element quality
    inverted-element detection
    nonlinear residual convergence
    energy consistency
    geometric volume preservation
    pressure-response consistency
    gravity-response reproducibility
    fiber sensitivity
    material sensitivity
    basal-boundary sensitivity
    cavity-pressure sensitivity.

Documented geometric divergence equation:

    Delta V (%) =
    |V_mask - V_mesh| / V_mask × 100

Documented target:
    Delta V <= 1.5%

Documented minimum Jacobian-quality target:
    > 0.35

Documented strict residual target:
    1e-5

Actual patient-level values:
Must be verified against native computational artifacts.

